"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, eldenring.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. The Archipelago mod folder will be downloaded into the game's main directory. The randomizer launcher will then launch automatically.",
